# Sandbox credentials for opt-in live-sandbox tests (comms-test.pahappa.net).
# Copy this file to .env and fill in real sandbox credentials to run the
# live-sandbox test cases in every SDK (single/multiple send, balance,
# rejection of >1000 numbers). Leave blank, or don't create .env at all,
# and those tests skip cleanly — only the wrong-credentials tests (which
# never need real creds) and the mocked tests will run.
#
# Never used against the live production API — only the sandbox.
COMMS_SANDBOX_USERNAME=
COMMS_SANDBOX_API_KEY=
